  "description": "IBOGAJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H84 N4 O18 Sm4,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm1F (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm2F (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.721-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.69-110.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm4(μ3-OH)2L2(acac)6]·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
